but  nonetheless you know bertot is going to  do everything in his power to save the  girl he loves we see porco and marcel  also exercising free will in their titan  forms  attacking the other titans that aaron is  summoning amir of the survey corps and  her dancing titan make an appearance too  this is actually a really cool  occurrence to have in one of the closing  chapters because all of these characters  from the past come back for this one  epic attempt to stop aaron's god-like  titan it's literally  aaron and the founding titan versus  everybody and everybody even includes  characters that have passed on mikasa  takes the opportunity to finally get the  titan-holding armament  after gabby hits it in the eye armin is  saved and the much-hated gabby had  something to do with it there is so much  hate for gabby in the anime watching  community now  i look forward to seeing if at least  some of them will change their opinion  about  her as the anime progresses to the end  clearly she's not as bad as she was  before  nor is brainwashed still it's hard to  forgive a character who killed our  precious potato girl  the cool thing is after the titan tries  to stab armin  and get him back he attacks it everyone  plays a role in saving him even himself  and also connie who cuts the tongue  of the titan so that armin doesn't drop  down with it and then annie who should  definitely end up with armin catches him  in the hands of her female titan armin  is soaked in titan fluids  as they make eye contact that's about as  romantic as attack on titan gets  as annie is about to be attacked we see  krueger's titan grisha's titan and what  we can assume is tom's beast titan which  seems to be a sort of ram  helping out they play a role in saving  annie it was already suggested before  but it's even clearer now that grisha  does not want aaron to carry out his  plan and neither does kruger an  interesting development for former ld  restorationists and possessors of the  attack titan  then even zeke helps levi find him he  waves over to him  you know it's the ultimate team effort  when even levi and zeke are on the same  page  zeke wants levi to cut off his head and  end the suffering and death because  remember  if zeke gets killed then aaron won't  have access to the founding titan power  anymore because he no longer has a royal  blooded titan  levi seemed so confused during this  whole thing he probably wanted to get  some truly satisfying revenge  after all zeke's done to his friends  comrades and even him but zeke takes  away that satisfying fantasy by  willingly presenting himself to be  killed and so of course levi can't take  any joy in killing him but he probably  does respect zeke more now than he did  before  according to arm and zeke is the one who  woke up those who were asleep in the  world of paths  where neither life nor death exists how  awesome is this stuff i love the  complexities that are woven into the  attack on titan world  it's mentioned that every alden is  connected to one another by the path  because the founder emir wants to be  connected thus we can assume that every  subject of emir who died is still alive  in a sense  just hasn't been woken up as grisha and  the others were  zeke has a very interesting conversation  with tom he admits that their dream of  euthanization was never realized and he  doesn't think it was a mistake  but now he says that if it meant getting  to play catch with tom again  then he wouldn't mind being born once  more after all  thus even for zeke one of the biggest  pessimists  the joys of life at least cancel out the  suffering he felt like his life was  worth it because of the joyous moments  he experienced with tom and as a result  he also thanks grisha his biological  father for bringing him into this world  and also for making it so that he would  meet tom  there is a very important lesson here  grisha could have been like tom to zeke  he could have prioritized moments of  connection with his son but instead he  just treated him as a tool in his grand  plan to restore elder  then we jump to armin who tells bertolt  that he took everything from him his  life  power precious memories and he doesn't  mention it but he could probably add  annie into the mix too  armand though still asks for his help  like zeke asks for toms and grishas and  as we see they do help and zeke as he's  about to get killed looks at the  beautiful day  a beauty he could never see when his  mind was always somewhere else focused  on accomplishing his master plan at all  costs  he wishes he realized earlier how  beautiful life can be  if you take the time to notice but he  admits that after all the killing he's  done  that's asking for too much and i know i  always reference code geass because it  is awesome and it's one of my favorite  series just like attack on titan is  but zeke didn't just kill he was also as  loose advised  prepared to be killed and you can at  least respect someone like that more  than someone who kills with no mercy but  then clings to life and does anything  possible to survive levi finishes the  job and you can  see in his face that he's conflicted he  carried out what he had to do  but he's not happy about it and so ends  the rivalry between  zeke and levi and it ends in a much  different way  than we probably expected in the end  their rivalry finished with an  understanding and  in an agreed-upon manner the rumbling  stops and jon finally activates the  explosives around aaron's titan's neck  the spine-like creature tries to  reattach to the head but this time  people are ready  reiner's titan tackles the creature and  although we definitely can't be sure at  this point  there is a very real possibility that  aaron might die it doesn't feel final  enough  so we'll definitely have a better sense  of what's going on in the next chapter  but anything can happen at this point  and it's clear to me that aaron was  prepared to die  as reiner holds 